From ace4def53562afeb23aecc73131815f1ce1e72d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chen Zhongjin <chenzhongjin@huawei.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Feb 2023 17:28:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 054/500] [Backport] sched: Add wrapper for get_wchan() to keep
 task blocked

mainline inclusion
from mainline-v5.16-rc1
commit 42a20f86dc19f9282d974df0ba4d226c865ab9dd
category: bugfix
bugzilla: 188409

Reference: https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git/commit/?id=42a20f86dc19f9282d974df0ba4d226c865ab9dd

--------------------------------

Having a stable wchan means the process must be blocked and for it to
stay that way while performing stack unwinding.

 Conflicts:
	arch/alpha/kernel/process.c
	arch/arm/kernel/process.c
	arch/arm64/kernel/process.c
	arch/csky/kernel/stacktrace.c
	arch/h8300/kernel/process.c
