	arch/sparc/kernel/process_64.c
	arch/um/kernel/process.c
	arch/x86/kernel/process.c
	arch/xtensa/kernel/process.c
	kernel/sched/core.c

Fix two format warnings in header file of ia64 and sparc.
Adapt sched/core.c to current version.

